<!--
    The status-bar icon. Solid white with transparency as the only other value:
    the system takes the alpha channel and throws the colours away, so anything
    with a fill other than opaque white comes out as a grey blob. Drawn heavier
    than the launcher icon for the same reason — it is shown at 24dp, next to
    the clock.
-->
